<title>CHINA: China December soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China December soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of soybean, soymill and soyoil as reported in official customs figures (percentage change is for January-December period compared with previous year):</p>
<p>		 DECEMBER IMPORTS   JAN-DEC IMPORTS    VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	  251,645	   1,107,539	  +276.7 PERCENT</p>
<p> Soymeal	  415,833	   1,876,478     +86,945.5</p>
<p> Soyoil	    85,109	   1,191,485	   -11.7</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		 DECEBER EXPORTS    JAN-DEC EXPORTS    VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	   36,156	    191,744	    -48.8 PERCENT</p>
<p> Soymeal	    1,315	     68,418	    -92.4</p>
<p> Soyoil	     3,603		7,211	    +16.0</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
